# Local diagnostic captures
# Run logs and device screenshots land at the repo root during hardware sessions. They are
# evidence for one run, not source, and reviewing a diff full of them hides the change.
*.log
captured-frame.png
nv12-frame.png
scaled-frame.png
tv-*.png

# Staged by the mobile release workflow, never by hand. The Fire TV package the phone can install is
# built from the same commit and copied in just before assembleRelease; committing one would ship a
# receiver from whenever somebody last ran the build locally.
mobile/src/main/assets/flint-receiver.apk
mobile/src/main/assets/flint-receiver.properties
